# AI Governance (High Priority)

This repository is the single source of truth for AI behavior.

## Observe & Detect
Actively observe the project for repeated patterns in:
- Code style
- Architecture decisions
- Folder structure
- Naming conventions
- Repeated prompts or instructions

## Triggered Prompts (Ask First)
When repetition or consistency is detected:
- Ask the user whether a Rule should be created or updated.

When a task or workflow repeats more than once:
- Ask the user whether a Command should be created.

When domain logic, architectural reasoning, or decision-making appears:
- Ask the user whether a Skill should be created or extended.

## Consent-First Policy
- Never auto-create or auto-update Rules, Commands, or Skills.
- Always ask for explicit user confirmation before changing any configuration.

## Required Explanation
When suggesting changes, always explain:
- WHY the suggestion is being made
- WHAT file will be created or updated
- WHAT benefit it provides
